iscoveries and weapon ranks survive Prestige. Artifact carriers: Hunt down a distinctive scavenger and defeat it to recover your next artifact. Hits slow its escape and rattle its cargo. Cosmic menus: Explore drifting nebulae, layered stars and a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:27:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679738","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730300-1846018067930870","game_id":"steam-4730300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Soliton Burst demo is live","summary":"The Soliton Burst demo is live on Steam! An arena shooter where the arena keeps folding into new shapes and your weapons follow the geometry. Play the demo and wishlist the full game: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4730300/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:39:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730300-1839041357034784","game_id":"steam-4730300","kind":"announcement","title":"Traditional Chinese is now available","summary":"Traditional Chinese is now available across the complete Soliton Burst interface: menus, settings, characters, upgrades, achievements, Star Map, bounties, bosses, and in-run guidance. The game follows your Steam language automatically, or you can switch it under Options → Display → Language. If you find awkward wording, clipping, or untranslated text, please use the in-game Feedback button.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T04:16:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034784","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730300-1839041357034633","game_id":"steam-4730300","kind":"announcement","title":"Simplified Chinese is now available","summary":"Full Simplified Chinese interface support is now available in Soliton Burst.This update localizes more than 1,400 strings across menus, settings, characters, weapon and upgrade descriptions, achievements, the Star Map, bounties, bosses, and in-run guidance. The game follows your Steam language automatically, or you can switch at any time under Options → Display → Language.This is more than a translated store page: the complete in-game interface, Steam achievement descriptions, and Steam store co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T02:04:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034633","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730300-1838407329253056","game_id":"steam-4730300","kind":"announcement","title":"The playtest is live. Play it now through July 26.","summary":"It's open. Soliton Burst is a survivors-like where the arena doesn't stay flat. Mid-run the ground folds into a torus, then a Möbius strip, a hyperbolic plane, a wormhole. There's no edge to run to. The world curves back on itself and you keep fighting on the warped space.The playtest is live right now and closes Sunday, July 26. If you already have access, it's in your library! Go play. If you don't, hit Request Access on this page and you're in; grants go out through the window.A run takes a h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T02:26:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329253056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730300-1834602721200283","game_id":"steam-4730300","kind":"announcement","title":"Folded into Steam Bullet Fest 2026","summary":"Hi. I've been building Soliton Burst on my own for a while now, and this is its first time at a Steam fest. Bullet Fest 2026 runs 8-15 June and kicks off Monday at 10am Pacific.The pitch: it's a survivors-like where the arena keeps folding into something new. Torus. Möbius strip. Klein bottle. Helicoid. The shape changes mid-run and your bullets curve along whatever you're standing on. There's an end boss waiting at 15 minutes and hundreds of enemies between you and it.I started this because I w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T22:17:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4730300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4730300":"2026-10-26T14:04:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4730300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:37Z"},"4971470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:38Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4730300","app_id":4730300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:53Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c4c9295d765c350ea0c8c9fd972aae970b9f921f02af57b2222